#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_TEMPLATENOTFOUND.string.text
msgid "The specified template could not be found."
msgstr "የ ተመረጠውን ቴምፕሌት ማግኘት አልተቻለም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_NOTATEMPLATE.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_NOTATEMPLATE.string.text
msgid "The file cannot be used as template."
msgstr "ፋይሉን እንደ ቴምፕሌት መጠቀም አይቻልም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTREADDOCINFO.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTREADDOCINFO.string.text
msgid ""
"Document information could not be read from the file because\n"
"the document information format is unknown or because document information "
"does not\n"
"exist."
msgstr ""
"የ ሰነዱን መረጃ ከ ሰነዱ ላይ ማንበብ አልተቻለም ምክንያቱም\n"
"የ ሰነዱ መረጃ አቀራረብ ያልታወቀ ነው: ወይንም የ ሰነዱ መረጃ የለም\n"
"ልውጣ"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_ALREADYOPEN.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_ALREADYOPEN.string.text
msgid "This document has already been opened for editing."
msgstr "ሰነዱ ቀደም ብሎ ለ እርማት ተከፍቶ ነበር"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_WRONGPASSWORD.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_WRONGPASSWORD.string.text
msgid "The wrong password has been entered."
msgstr "የ ተሳሳተ የ መግቢያ ቃል ነው ያስገቡት"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_DOLOADFAILED.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_DOLOADFAILED.string.text
msgid "Error reading file."
msgstr "ስህተት ፋይሉን በ ማንበብ ላይ"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_DOCUMENTREADONLY.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_DOCUMENTREADONLY.string.text
msgid "The document was opened as read-only."
msgstr "ሰነዱ የ ተከፈተው ለ ንባብ-ብቻ ነው"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_OLEGENERAL.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_OLEGENERAL.string.text
msgid "General OLE Error."
msgstr "ባጠቃላይ የ OLE ስህተት"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_INET_NAME_RESOLVE.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_INET_NAME_RESOLVE.string.text
msgid "The host name $(ARG1) could not be resolved."
msgstr "የ ጋባዡን ስም $(ARG1) መወሰን አልተቻለም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_INET_CONNECT.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_INET_CONNECT.string.text
msgid "Could not establish Internet connection to $(ARG1)."
msgstr "የ ኢንተርኔት ግንኙነት መመስረት አልተቻለም $(ARG1)."

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_INET_READ.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_INET_READ.string.text
msgid ""
"Error reading data from the Internet.\n"
"Server error message: $(ARG1)."
msgstr ""
"ስህተት ዳታውን ከ ኢንተርኔት በ ማንበብ ላይ\n"
"የ ሰርቨሩ የ ስህተት መልእክት: $(ARG1)."

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_INET_WRITE.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_INET_WRITE.string.text
msgid ""
"Error transferring data to the Internet.\n"
"Server error message: $(ARG1)."
msgstr ""
"ስህተት ዳታ ወደ ኢንተርኔት በ ማስተላለፍ ላይ\n"
"የ ሰርቨሩ የ ስህተት መልእክት: $(ARG1)."

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_INET_GENERAL.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_INET_GENERAL.string.text
msgid "General Internet error has occurred."
msgstr "ባጠቃላይ የ ኢንተርኔት ስህተት ተፈጥሯል"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_INET_OFFLINE.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_INET_OFFLINE.string.text
msgid ""
"The requested Internet data is not available in the cache and cannot be "
"transmitted as the Online mode has not been activated."
msgstr ""
"የተጠየቀው የኢንተርኔት ዳታ ዝግጁ አይደለም በ cache ውስጥ እና ማስተላለፍ አይቻልም እንደ Online mode "
"አልተነሳም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFXMSG_STYLEREPLACE.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFXMSG_STYLEREPLACE.string.text
msgid "Should the $(ARG1) Style be replaced?"
msgstr "ይህን $(ARG1) ዘዴ ልቀይረው?"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_NOFILTER.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_NOFILTER.string.text
msgid "A filter has not been found."
msgstr "ማጣሪያ አልተገኘም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTFINDORIGINAL.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTFINDORIGINAL.string.text
msgid "The original could not be determined."
msgstr "ዋናውን መወሰን አልተቻለም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTCREATECONTENT.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTCREATECONTENT.string.text
msgid "The contents could not be created."
msgstr "ይዞታዎችን መፍጠር አልተቻለም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTCREATELINK.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTCREATELINK.string.text
msgid "The link could not be created."
msgstr "አገናኝ መፍጠር አልተቻለም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_WRONGBMKFORMAT.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_WRONGBMKFORMAT.string.text
msgid "The link format is invalid."
msgstr "የ አገናኙ አቀራረብ ዋጋ የለውም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_WRONGICONFILE.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_WRONGICONFILE.string.text
msgid "The configuration of the icon display is invalid."
msgstr "የ ምልክት ማሳያው ማዋቀሪያ ዋጋ የለውም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTWRITEICONFILE.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTWRITEICONFILE.string.text
msgid "The configuration of the icon display can not be saved."
msgstr "የ ምልክት ማሳያው ማዋቀሪያውን ማስቀመጥ አልተቻለም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTDELICONFILE.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTDELICONFILE.string.text
msgid "The configuration of the icon display could not be deleted."
msgstr "የ ምልክት ማሳያው ማዋቀሪያውን ማጥፋት አልተቻለም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTRENAMECONTENT.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTRENAMECONTENT.string.text
msgid "Contents cannot be renamed."
msgstr "ይዞታዎችን እንደገና መሰየም አልተቻለም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_INVALIDBMKPATH.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_INVALIDBMKPATH.string.text
msgid "The bookmark folder is invalid."
msgstr "ምልክት ማድረጊያው ፎልደር ዋጋ የለውም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTWRITEURLCFGFILE.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTWRITEURLCFGFILE.string.text
msgid "The configuration of the URLs to be saved locally could not be saved."
msgstr "የ URLs ማዋቀሪያ በ አካባቢው ውስጥ ሊቀመጥ የነበረውን ማስቀመጥ አልተቻለም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_WRONGURLCFGFORMAT.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_WRONGURLCFGFORMAT.string.text
msgid "The configuration format of the URLs to be saved locally is invalid."
msgstr "የ URLs አቀራረብ ማዋቀሪያ በ አካባቢው ውስጥ ሊቀመጥ የነበረውን ማስቀመጥ አልተቻለም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_NODOCUMENT.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_NODOCUMENT.string.text
msgid "This action cannot be applied to a document that does not exist."
msgstr "ይህን ተግባር መፈጸም አይቻልም ሰነዱ አልተገኘም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_INVALIDLINK.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_INVALIDLINK.string.text
msgid "The link refers to an invalid target."
msgstr "አገናኙ የሚመረው ኢላማ ዋጋ የለውም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_INVALIDTRASHPATH.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_INVALIDTRASHPATH.string.text
msgid "The Recycle Bin path is invalid."
msgstr ""

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_NOTRESTORABLE.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_NOTRESTORABLE.string.text
msgid "The entry could not be restored."
msgstr "ያስገቡትን እንደ ነበር መመለስ አልተቻለም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_NAMETOOLONG.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_NAMETOOLONG.string.text
msgid "The file name is too long for the target file system."
msgstr "የ ፋይሉ ስም በጣም ረጅም ነው ለ ኢላማው ፋይል ስርአት"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CONSULTUSER.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CONSULTUSER.string.text
msgid "The details for running the function are incomplete."
msgstr "ተግባሩን ለ ማስኬድ ዝርዝሮቹ የተሟሉ አይደሉም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_INVALIDSYNTAX.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_INVALIDSYNTAX.string.text
msgctxt "errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_INVALIDSYNTAX.string.text"
msgid "The input syntax is invalid."
msgstr "ያስገቡት አገባብ ዋጋ የለውም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTCREATEFOLDER.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTCREATEFOLDER.string.text
msgctxt "errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTCREATEFOLDER.string.text"
msgid "The input syntax is invalid."
msgstr "ያስገቡት አገባብ ዋጋ የለውም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTRENAMEFOLDER.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTRENAMEFOLDER.string.text
msgctxt "errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTRENAMEFOLDER.string.text"
msgid "The input syntax is invalid."
msgstr "ያስገቡት አገባብ ዋጋ የለውም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_WRONG_CDF_FORMAT.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_WRONG_CDF_FORMAT.string.text
msgid "The channel document has an invalid format."
msgstr "የ ሰነድ መገናኛው ዋጋ የሌለው አቀራረብ ነው ያለው"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_EMPTY_SERVER.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_EMPTY_SERVER.string.text
msgid "The server must not be empty."
msgstr "ሰርቨሩ ባዶ መሆን የለበትም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_NO_ABOBOX.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_NO_ABOBOX.string.text
msgid "A subscription folder is required to install a Channel."
msgstr "መገናኛውን ለ መግጠም የ ማህበረተኝነት ፎልደር ያስፈልጋል"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_NOTSTORABLEINBINARYFORMAT.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_NOTSTORABLEINBINARYFORMAT.string.text
msgid ""
"This document contains attributes that cannot be saved in the selected "
"format.\n"
"Please save the document in a %PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION file format."
msgstr ""

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_TARGETFILECORRUPTED.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_TARGETFILECORRUPTED.string.text
msgid ""
"The file $(FILENAME) cannot be saved. Please check your system settings. You "
"can find an automatically generated backup copy of this file in folder "
"$(PATH) named $(BACKUPNAME)."
msgstr ""
"ፋይሉን $(FILENAME) ማስቀመጥ አልተቻለም: እባክዎን የ ስርአት ማሰናጃውን ይመርምሩ: ራሱ በራሱ የመነጨ የዚህን "
"ፋይል ኮፒ በ ፎልደር ውስጥ ያገኛሉ $(PATH) ስሙ $(BACKUPNAME)."

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_NOMOREDOCUMENTSALLOWED.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_NOMOREDOCUMENTSALLOWED.string.text
msgid ""
"The maximum number of documents that can be opened at the same time has been "
"reached. You need to close one or more documents before you can open a new "
"document."
msgstr ""
"በ አንድ ጊዜ ሊከፍቱት የሚችሉትን ከፍተኛው የ ሰንድ ቁጥር ላይ ደርሰዋል: አንድ ወይንም ሁለት ሰንዶችን መዝጋት "
"አለብዎት አዲስ ሰነድ ከ መክፈትዎት በፊት:"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTCREATEBACKUP.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_CANTCREATEBACKUP.string.text
msgid "Could not create backup copy."
msgstr "ተተኪ ኮፒ መፍጠር አልተቻለም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_MACROS_SUPPORT_DISABLED.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_MACROS_SUPPORT_DISABLED.string.text
msgid ""
"An attempt was made to execute a macro.\n"
"For security reasons, macro support is disabled."
msgstr ""
"ማክሮ ለ ማስኬድ ሙከራ ተድርጓል\n"
"ለ ደህንነት ምክንያት ሲባል የ ማክሮ ድጋፍ ተሰናክሏል"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_DOCUMENT_MACRO_DISABLED.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_DOCUMENT_MACRO_DISABLED.string.text
msgid ""
"This document contains macros.\n"
"\n"
"Macros may contain viruses. Execution of macros is disabled due to the "
"current macro security setting in Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME - Security."
"\n"
"\n"
"Therefore, some functionality may not be available."
msgstr ""
"ይህ ሰነድ ማክሮ ይዟል\n"
"\n"
"ማክሮ ምናልባት ቫይረሶች ሊይዙ ይችላሉ: ማክሮ ማስኬጃው ተሰናክሏል: ይህ ማክሮ በ ደህንነት ማሰናጃዎች ተሰናክሏል: ከ "
"መሳሪያዎች - ምርጫዎች - %PRODUCTNAME - ደህንነት\n"
"\n"
"ስለዚህ አንዳንድ ተግባሮች በትክክል ላይሰሩ ይችላሉ"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_BROKENSIGNATURE.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_BROKENSIGNATURE.string.text
msgid ""
"The digitally signed document content and/or macros do not match the current "
"document signature.\n"
"\n"
"This could be the result of document manipulation or of structural document "
"damage due to data transmission.\n"
"\n"
"We recommend that you do not trust the content of the current document.\n"
"Execution of macros is disabled for this document.\n"
" "
msgstr ""
"የ ዲጂታል ፊርማ የያዘው ሰነድ ይዞታ እና/ወይንም ማክሮ ከ አሁኑ ሰነድ ፊርማ ጋር አይመሳሰልም\n"
"\n"
"ይህ ውጤት የሚፈጠረው ሰነዱን ለ እርስዎ እንዲስማማ ሲቀይሩ ነው ወይንም የ ሰነዱ አካል ዳታው በሚተላለፍበት ጊዜ "
"የተበላሸ ነው\n"
"\n"
"የ አሁኑን ሰነድ ይዞታ እንዳያምኑት እንመክራለን\n"
"ለዚህ ሰነድ ማክሮ ማስኬጃ ተሰናክሏል\n"
" "

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_INCOMPLETE_ENCRYPTION.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_INCOMPLETE_ENCRYPTION.string.text
msgid ""
"The encrypted document contains unexpected non-encrypted streams.\n"
"\n"
"This could be the result of document manipulation.\n"
"\n"
"We recommend that you do not trust the content of the current document.\n"
"Execution of macros is disabled for this document.\n"
" "
msgstr ""

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_INVALIDLENGTH.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_INVALIDLENGTH.string.text
msgid "Invalid data length."
msgstr "ዋጋ የሌለው የ ዳታ እርዝመት"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_CURRENTDIR.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_CURRENTDIR.string.text
msgid "Function not possible: path contains current directory."
msgstr "ተግባሩን መፈጸም አይቻልም: መንገዱ የ አሁኑን ዳይሬክቶሪ ይዟል"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_NOTSAMEDEVICE.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_NOTSAMEDEVICE.string.text
msgid "Function not possible: device (drive) not identical."
msgstr "ተግባሩን መፈጸም አይቻልም: አካሉ (drive) ተመሳሳይ አይደለም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_DEVICENOTREADY.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_DEVICENOTREADY.string.text
msgid "Device (drive) not ready."
msgstr "አካሉ (drive) ዝግጁ አይደለም"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_BADCRC.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_BADCRC.string.text
msgid "Wrong check amount."
msgstr "የተሳሳተ የ ምርመራ መጠን"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_WRITEPROTECTED.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_IO_WRITEPROTECTED.string.text
msgid "Function not possible: write protected."
msgstr "ተግባሩን መፈጸም አልተቻለም: መጻፍ የተከለከለ ነው:"

#: errtxt.src#RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_SHARED_NOPASSWORDCHANGE.string.text
#: errtxt.src%23RID_ERRHDL.ERRCODE_SFX_SHARED_NOPASSWORDCHANGE.string.text
msgid ""
"The password of a shared spreadsheet cannot be set or changed.\n"
"Deactivate sharing mode first."
msgstr ""
"የሚካፈሉትን የሰንጠረዥ የ መግቢያ ቃል ማዘጋጀት አልተቻለም ወይንም ተቀይሯል \n"
"በ መጀመሪያ የ መካፈያ ዘዴን ያቦዝኑ"
